# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Nested repositories — each has its own .git and is versioned
# independently (or is simply a clone of someone else's public repo).
# Tracking any of these here would create an embedded repo neither side
# can manage properly, and several are hundreds of MB to 2GB+ of cloned
# model weights that have no business in a personal project history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
